**Records.**  `OUTSTANDING_BUGS.md`: the `shfcnvsdfpul` entry marked fixed by this commit; the prose row's "the same UB `(int32_t)` cast
`#297` removed from FTRC" corrected in place to "the same `(int32_t)` cast that `#297` GUARDED in FTRC behind a range ladder (the casts
