codex
The witness and raw scores support the one-line fix. The detector does have a narrower destination scope than the packet suggests: it checks FPUL preservation at DR0 and DR2, but reads converted results only at DR2. I’m checking how that gap should be disclosed and whether the artifacts establish the claimed pre-table timing.

