I recounted all 11 raw logs: every score and red-row list matches the packet, and the as-run detector has 52 sessions with nine mode-discriminating vectors. The pre-table timing needs a precise record: the scratch file was created just before the base run, but its current contents were modified afterward. I found no executable defect in the proposed deletion; the remaining changes concern coverage disclosures and record accuracy.

